
@MODE (TCP-IP)TCP-IP-LO-C07:MODE,,

@CC ====================================================================

@CC =                                                                  =

@CC = FILE NAME: TCP-IP-LO:MODE                                        =

@CC = LOADING OF COSMOS TCP/IP GATEWAY VERSION C                       =

@CC = TO BE RUN DURING COLD-START IN THE FILE HENT-MODE:MODE, ANYWHERE =

@CC = AFTER THE 'INITIALIZE-BACKGROUND-PROGRAMS' COMMAND IS EXECUTED.  =

@CC =                                                                  =

@CC ====================================================================

@CC *********************************************************

@CC * TCP-CONTROL,TELNET+TCP/IP,FTP-START,POWERFAIL-HANDLER *

@CC *********************************************************

@OPERATOR *** COSMOS TCP/IP GATEWAY IS BEING DUMPED ***

@ABORT tcpp

ILLEGAL PARAMETER

@ABORT ftprt

ILLEGAL PARAMETER

@ABORT popwr

ILLEGAL PARAMETER

@(TCP-IP)PO-STOP-C07 0

@SCHEDULE 503

@RT-LOADER


REAL TIME LOADER,  SINTRAN III VSX - L

