*DECLARE-PROGRAM TCPP,,,,
*END-LOAD
*YES
*CHANGE-RT-DESCRIPTION TCPP,30,TCPPS,,20,2,,,,,,,,
*WRITE-SEGMENT TCPPS,,


  SEG.  SEG.    LOWER  UPPER  MASS  SEG. RING PIT SEG.  SEG.
  NO.   NAME    ADDR.  ADDR.  ADDR. FILE          PROT  TYPE

   145 TCPPS        0 111777 12663    0    0   1  RFW   DEMAND
