@MODE (TCP-IP)DEFINE-TCPP-C07:MODE,,

@CC %-------------------------------------------------------%

@CC % Patch to install TCPP as a SINTRAN system server      %

@CC %-------------------------------------------------------%


@DMAC


* DMAC-1915G *

JULY 22, 1988


)RESSM
)CLEAR
)CLOAD S3PATCH
176000/004057  SSTAR
)SYSDF
)9ASSM SYMBOL-1-LIST
 **** 000000 DIAGNOSTICS **** 

?



)CLOAD S3CP
30002/123567  SGF3=^
PSSD=SSTAR-1
% ---------    UPDATE SYSTEM SERVER TABLE INDEX 7B -----
PSSD/106660  ^+16/000000   SGF3;100002
% ---------    ADD SERVER NAME ON COMMAND SEGM.   -------
SGF3/177777  'TCPP'

%--------------------------------------------------------
)KILL PSSD+
)KILL SGF3; SGF3=*; SGF3:+123572  
)CLOAD S3CP
30002/123567  SGF3
)9EXIT
